/T (The source contains three repeated search forms. Each form points to /catalog/, uses a text input named q and a submit button. No explicit method is declared, so the browser defaults to GET. The search inputs have placeholders but no visible labels connected with the for and id attributes. The source also contains six tables. None has a caption, thead or th cells; four contain tbody. Their one-row structures indicate layout use rather than accessible data tables.)
